[I] MMS stream protocol library

[T] libmms is a library for receiving mms:// and mmsh:// network streams,
[T] commonly used for streaming Windows Media content. It only receives
[T] streams and was created to replace the separate MMS implementations of
[T] various free software projects.

[U] https://sourceforge.net/projects/libmms/

[A] Libmms Authors
